## Interface: 90207
## Title: Epsilook
## Notes: Search and inspect Epsilon's spell data.
## Author: Nataari
## Version: 0.2
## OptionalDeps: Epsilook_Data
## X-Website: https://natans8.github.io/Epsilook/
## SavedVariables: EpsilookSettings

# The pack, read: bytes to values, and the mount that says where a column lives.
Pack\Reader.lua
Pack\Data.lua
Pack\Text.lua

# The query language and the kernel that answers it.
Engine\Schema.lua
Engine\Query.lua
Engine\Match.lua
Engine\Search.lua

# The supported surface, which returns data and performs nothing.
API.lua

# The interfaces over it. Config is below them all and the engine never reads it.
Interface\Config.lua
Interface\Shell.lua
Interface\Inspect.lua
Interface\Options.lua

SelfTest.lua
